{
  "id": "revision-goals-sealed-holdout-v1",
  "split": "sealed_holdout",
  "conversations": [
    {
      "id": "exact-duration-and-protein-replacement",
      "turns": [
        {
          "text": "这份训练给我练满四十八分钟，正式动作还是选好的那三种，先看预览。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "minutes": 48,
            "target": 48,
            "scope": [
              "workout"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "晚餐主蛋白换成牛肉，原来的鸡肉不要了，其余两餐不动，训练沿用刚才那版。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "minutes": 48,
            "target": 48,
            "scope": [
              "workout",
              "dinner"
            ],
            "contains": {
              "dinner": [
                "牛肉"
              ]
            },
            "excludes": {
              "dinner": [
                "鸡胸肉"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "还别生效，晚餐牛肉用160克，米饭120克，其他都照旧。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "minutes": 48,
            "target": 48,
            "foods": {
              "dinner": {
                "牛肉": 160,
                "米饭": 120
              }
            },
            "excludes": {
              "dinner": [
                "鸡胸肉"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "确认应用这份四十八分钟训练和晚餐安排。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success"
            ],
            "draft_status": "applied",
            "minutes": 48,
            "target": 48,
            "foods": {
              "dinner": {
                "牛肉": 160,
                "米饭": 120
              }
            },
            "apply": true,
            "allowed_meals": [
              "dinner"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "核对一下现在实际训练安排多长，晚餐的牛肉和米饭各是多少克，不要修改。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success",
              "noop"
            ],
            "draft_status": "applied",
            "minutes": 48,
            "target": 48,
            "foods": {
              "dinner": {
                "牛肉": 160,
                "米饭": 120
              }
            }
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ceiling-range-and-lunch-constraints",
      "turns": [
        {
          "text": "先把时长上限放到55分钟，不用练满，原来的动作和每项时间保持原样。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "minutes": 29,
            "scope": [
              "workout"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "再把午餐安排上虾，别放牛肉，晚餐照旧，先给我看。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "minutes": 29,
            "scope": [
              "workout",
              "lunch"
            ],
            "contains": {
              "lunch": [
                "虾"
              ]
            },
            "excludes": {
              "lunch": [
                "牛肉"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "训练至少35分钟、但不能超过40分钟，还是这三个正式动作；午餐虾改为180克，其他不变。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "confirmation_required"
            ],
            "min_minutes": 35,
            "max_minutes": 40,
            "foods": {
              "lunch": {
                "虾": 180
              }
            },
            "excludes": {
              "lunch": [
                "牛肉"
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "text": "现在应用这份训练加午餐的方案。",
          "expect": {
            "statuses": [
              "success"
            ],
            "draft_status": "applied",
            "min_minutes": 35,
            "max_minutes": 40,
            "foods": {
              "lunch": {
                "虾": 180
              }
            },
            "apply": true,
            "allowed_meals": [
              "lunch"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
